AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/type> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECO_0007636>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "url:https://ncit.nci.nih.gov/ncitbrowser/ConceptReport.jsp?dictionary=NCI_Thesaurus&ns=ncit&code=C26726") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_0050117> "A disease that is the consequence of the presence of pathogenic microbial agents, including pathogenic viruses, pathogenic bacteria, fungi, protozoa, multicellular parasites, and aberrant proteins known as prions."@en)
