# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_0050338> (primary bacterial infectious disease)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/type> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECO_0007638>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "url:http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Infectious_disease") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/DOID_0050338> "A bacterial infectious disease that results_in infection by bacteria as a result of their presence or activity within the normal, healthy host, and their intrinsic virulence is, in part, a necessary consequence of their need to reproduce and spread."@en)
